OL,3,GNEWSA'Mr Spitfire' garage fuselage
OL,4,Afetches over #20,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fuselage of a Spitfire that had
OL,7,Fbeen kept in a garage for more than two
OL,8,Fdecades has been sold at auction for
OL,9,Fmore than #20,000.
OL,11,FThe Supermarine Spitfire F Mk. XXII,
OL,12,Fserial number PK519, was the final
OL,13,Fproject of the late renowned aviation
OL,14,Fenthusiast Peter Arnold, who lived in
OL,15,FNewport Pagnell, Buckinghamshire.
OL,17,FArnold, who was known as "Mr Spitfire"
OL,18,Fwheeled the plane out from time to time
OL,19,Ffor all to see. He died, aged 83, in
OL,20,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
